If nCount > 0;
	nCount := 1;
EndIf;

rules.rationale:
`:IF`, `:WHILE`, `:FOR` and `:CASE` lines are statements like any other. Authors
from C-family languages leave the semicolon off a line that opens a block,
and the next line is then read as part of the condition.

